          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Soletta Today",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_n4HrtF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We started Soletta because that drink barely exists outside of Sicily. And when you do find something close to it, it's usually cutting a corner somewhere: flavor concentrate standing in for real fruit, or so much sugar that \"refreshing\" isn't really the point anymore. We wanted the actual thing, so we made it ourselves.<br/>Whether you're two hours into a workday that needs a reset, three drinks into a night that needs one more mixer, or standing at a table where the drink matters as much as the company does, it's the same bottle, the same three ingredients, the same idea that's been around since 1896: a good thing doesn't need much help.<br/><br/><br/></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
